{"id":2379,"date":"2022-08-29T12:14:40","date_gmt":"2022-08-29T12:14:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=2379"},"modified":"2024-02-15T09:30:11","modified_gmt":"2024-02-15T09:30:11","slug":"climate-change-reading-for-kids","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/climate-change-reading-for-kids\/","title":{"rendered":"Climate Change Reading for Kids"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"534\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-change-reading-kids-1024x534.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2927 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-change-reading-kids-1024x534.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-change-reading-kids-300x157.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-change-reading-kids-768x401.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-change-reading-kids-360x188.jpg 360w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-change-reading-kids-200x104.jpg 200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-change-reading-kids.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/534;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Climate Crisis for Beginners: A Climate Change book for Children (Usborne)<\/strong><\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/usborne.com\/gb\/climate-crisis-for-beginners-9781474979863#:~:text=This%20book%20explains%2C%20in%20simple,is%20having%20on%20our%20planet.\">Climate Crisis for Beginners: A Climate Change<\/a>&nbsp;book for Children is part of an award-winning \u2018For Beginners\u2019 series. It explains the basics: the greenhouse effect, the danger from burning fossil fuels, why we know there is a climate crisis, and what we need to do to make a difference.<\/p>\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"678\" height=\"1000\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-crisis-beginners.jpg\" alt=\"Climate Crisis for Beginners: A Climate Change book for Children (Usborne)\" class=\"wp-image-2925 size-full lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-crisis-beginners.jpg 678w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-crisis-beginners-203x300.jpg 203w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-crisis-beginners-136x200.jpg 136w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/climate-crisis-beginners-85x125.jpg 85w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 678px) 100vw, 678px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 678px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 678\/1000;\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>DK Find Out! Climate Change (Dorling Kindersly)<\/strong><\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.dk.com\/uk\/book\/9781465493156-dkfindout-climate-change\/\">DK Find Out! Climate Change<\/a>&nbsp;explains the ways in which we have caused the Earth to heat up, from traffic pollution to animal farming, and the effects we are causing. It includes a timeline from the 1760s to 2050, on living with climate change and what we can do about it.<\/p>\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"779\" height=\"1000\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/find-out-climate-change.jpg\" alt=\"DK Find Out! Climate Change (Dorling Kindersly)\" class=\"wp-image-2924 size-full lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/find-out-climate-change.jpg 779w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/find-out-climate-change-234x300.jpg 234w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/find-out-climate-change-768x986.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/find-out-climate-change-156x200.jpg 156w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/find-out-climate-change-97x125.jpg 97w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 779px) 100vw, 779px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 779px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 779\/1000;\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Under the Weather: Stories About Climate Change (Frances Lincoln Publishers)<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.goodreads.com\/book\/show\/8872821-under-the-weather\">Under the Weather: Stories About Climate Change by Tony Bradman&nbsp;<\/a>is a collection of short stories from award-winning children\u2019s authors, set in locations around the globe, such as Serbia and Canada, Australia, the UK, Sri Lanka and the Philippines. Stories portray the personal impact of climate change, from the effects of rising sea levels to changes in animal behaviour and human lifestyles.<\/p>\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"642\" height=\"1000\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/under-the-weather.jpg\" alt=\"Under the Weather: Stories About Climate Change (Frances Lincoln Publishers)\" class=\"wp-image-2923 size-full lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/under-the-weather.jpg 642w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/under-the-weather-193x300.jpg 193w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/under-the-weather-128x200.jpg 128w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/under-the-weather-80x125.jpg 80w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 642px) 100vw, 642px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 642px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 642\/1000;\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Book recommendations designed to teach children about climate change. <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2926,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[10],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-2379","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-climate-change-reading-for-kids"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Climate Change Reading for Kids<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Book recommendations designed to teach children about climate change.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/climate-change-reading-for-kids\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Climate Change Reading for Kids\" \/>\n<meta property=